# Release policy

- Prefer GitOps PR generation over direct Kubernetes, Helm, Terraform, or cloud console mutation.
- Deny production shell, kubectl apply, helm upgrade, and terraform apply from agent sessions.
- Canary promote/rollback recommendations are advisory until a human approves.
- Provenance and SBOM checks fail closed when attestations are missing.
- No tag/publish without approval; multi-agent release commander requires final human approval.
- Change-freeze calendars override convenience; exceptions need a named approver and expiry.
- Post-change verification (health, SLO, error budget) is mandatory after any approved apply.
